         <div type="apparatus">
            <p>The width measurement (from ICVR edition) is approximate. "Titulus fere processit hic quie[scit in pace vir no]mine Laur[entius sanctus p]rb. [eccl. cathol., dep. die] Satu[rni] XV kal. ia[n., qui vixit] ann. p.m. [X]XII, post cons. Hono[ri] Aug. III[I et E]utychiani v. c. etc." (so Ferrua in ICVR ad loc. cit.).&#xD;
In her transcription, Bultrighini 2017 does not underline the lost letters. The datation proposed by Bultrighini 2017 is 18th December 398, differently from Ferrua (ICVR ad loc. cit.) who proposed 399 (Felle)</p>
         </div>
